"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to change how Auto Terms analyzes "
"your posts. You will need to know how to write Regular Expressions to use "
"this feature."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro et permet canviar com analitza els termes "
"automàtics les teves publicacions. Necessitaràs saber com escriure "
"expressions regulars per utilitzar aquesta funció."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:616
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to connect terms. When the main term or any of "
"these terms are added to the post, all the other terms will be added also."
msgstr ""
