msgstr "Funció de termes sinònims"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:678
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to have multiple words associated "
"with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds "
"a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro et permet tenir múltiples paraules associades "
"amb un sol terme. Si PublishPress Taxonomies escaneja el teu contingut i "
"troba un sinònim, actuarà com si hagués trobat el terme principal."

